#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:5
#: 8b045f052b8b47d1b31f1bfdb8b86fe6
msgid "NVidia TX1 as a Companion Computer"
msgstr "NVidia TX1 作为伴飞计算机"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:7
#: 1429fe095c904c0bbfe93e6a0f239e01
msgid ""
"This page explains how to connect and configure an `NVidia TX1 "
"<http://www.nvidia.com/object/jetson-tx1-dev-kit.html>`__ using "
"`AuVidea.eu's J120 carrier board <http://auvidea.com/j120/>`__ so that it is"
" able to communicate with a Pixhawk flight controller using the MAVLink "
"protocol over a serial connection."
msgstr ""
"本页说明如何使用 `AuVidea.eu 的 J120 载板 <http://auvidea.com/j120/>`__ 连接和配置 `NVidia "
"TX1 <http://www.nvidia.com/object/jetson-tx1-dev-kit.html>`__，使其能够通过串行连接上的 "
"MAVLink 协议与 Pixhawk 飞控进行通信。"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:10
#: 9d921d35f3124342a57b7eb6e413924a
msgid "Connecting the Pixhawk and TX1"
msgstr "连接 Pixhawk 和 TX1"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:14
#: 3af2995a1de94828a1c5935bcc9b65e2
msgid ""
"Connect the Pixhawk's TELEM2 port to the J120's UART2 port's Ground, TX and "
"RX pins as shown in the image above."
msgstr "如上图所示，将 Pixhawk 的 TELEM2 端口连接到 J120 的 UART2 端口的 GND、TX 和 RX 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:16
#: 1d094dcf18db4366b42dd716f7fa1cf0
msgid ""
"The Pixhawk and TX1 should be powered separately (the J120/TX1 through its "
"12V power input port, the Pixhawk through its POWER port).  They should be "
"powered on at about the same time or the TX1 powered on first to avoid the "
"Pixhawk interrupting the TX1's bootloader."
msgstr ""
"Pixhawk 和 TX1 应分别独立供电（J120/TX1 通过其 12V 电源输入口供电，Pixhawk 通过其 POWER "
"口供电）。应大约同时上电，或先给 TX1 上电，以避免 Pixhawk 打断 TX1 的引导加载程序。"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:19
#: fd507f8b56fa4393be91ef14536a4b62
msgid "Setup the Pixhawk"
msgstr "设置 Pixhawk"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:21
#: 2b03e439595442a1b9853a1fbe91ac52
msgid ""
"Connect to the Pixhawk with a ground station (i.e. Mission Planner) and set "
"the following parameters:"
msgstr "使用地面站（如 Mission Planner）连接 Pixhawk 并设置以下参数："

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:23
#: 2a8e04d7bdd94831a73258dcc10e3cd4
msgid ""
":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <copter:SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 1 (the default) to "
"enable MAVLink on the serial port."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <copter:SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 1（默认值），以在串口上启用 MAVLink。"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:24
#: 08ee7377f2ad40edab16eaac0b452b47
msgid ""
":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <copter:SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 921 so the Pixhawk can "
"communicate with the TX1 at 921600 baud."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <copter:SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 921，使 Pixhawk 能以 921600 波特率与 TX1"
" 通信。"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:25
#: 2452258828aa4ce2856d2ae518e33b65
msgid ""
":ref:`LOG_BACKEND_TYPE <copter:LOG_BACKEND_TYPE>` = 3 if you are using "
"APSync to stream the dataflash log files to the TX1"
msgstr ""
":ref:`LOG_BACKEND_TYPE <copter:LOG_BACKEND_TYPE>` = 3，如果使用 APSync 将 "
"dataflash 日志文件流传输到 TX1"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:27
#: 1877795f14924ecca875dd4bb1dcf1f7
msgid ""
"You may need to manually disable flow control on Telem2 although this is not"
" normally required:"
msgstr "通常情况下不需要，但您可能需要手动禁用 Telem2 上的流控制："

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:29
#: 4593009b58d7492a884d6beed1dac971
msgid ":ref:`BRD_SER2_RTSCTS <copter:BRD_SER2_RTSCTS>` = 0"
msgstr ":ref:`BRD_SER2_RTSCTS <copter:BRD_SER2_RTSCTS>` = 0"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:31
#: 6c9abce526a846809e7667f60bcc21c2
msgid "As a side note the J120's UART2 appears on the TX1 as /dev/ttyTHS1."
msgstr "补充说明：J120 的 UART2 在 TX1 上显示为 /dev/ttyTHS1。"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:34
#: fd8df68d5701441bb747d11ed98950b9
msgid "Setup the TX1"
msgstr "设置 TX1"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:36
#: c6a9bee667f24102822dcf36c8f5e62f
msgid "There are two steps required to setting up the TX1:"
msgstr "设置 TX1 需要两个步骤："

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:38
#: bb8ac81ad58045ffb727003a5e71ab5d
msgid ""
"install JetPack-3.0 to an Ubuntu 16 desktop and flash the TX1 operating "
"system"
msgstr "在 Ubuntu 16 桌面上安装 JetPack-3.0 并烧录 TX1 操作系统"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:39
#: 5394b2977331434e91720aea0ea67614
msgid "flash the APSync image to the TX1"
msgstr "将 APSync 镜像烧录到 TX1"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:42
#: 62e986cad22c497b83e4ca79715937bf
msgid "Installing JetPack-3.0 and flashing the OS"
msgstr "安装 JetPack-3.0 并烧录操作系统"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:44
#: 981d108c39ea4c48b2a5f8dfcb144611
msgid "First put the TX1 into bootloader mode"
msgstr "首先将 TX1 置于引导加载程序模式"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:46
#: 45c3a8b355164ed8b8193e9851b7577f
msgid "connect the TX1 to an Ubuntu 16.04 machine using a USB cable"
msgstr "使用 USB 线将 TX1 连接到 Ubuntu 16.04 机器"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:47
#: e93b26a9ec374be0b10c6d30e78535d7
msgid ""
"put the TX1 into bootloader mode by holding the \"Force Recovery\" button "
"(aka \"REC\"), then press the \"Reset\" button (aka \"RST\") and then "
"release the \"Force Recovery\" button"
msgstr ""
"按住「Force Recovery」按钮（即「REC」），然后按「Reset」按钮（即「RST」），再松开「Force Recovery」按钮，使 "
"TX1 进入引导加载程序模式"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:48
#: 6e45557e13f7473a9eba16b17e75c53e
msgid ""
"check the TX1 is in bootloader mode by typing \"lsusb\" on the Ubuntu "
"machine and look for \"NVidia Corp\""
msgstr "在 Ubuntu 机器上输入「lsusb」，查找「NVidia Corp」，确认 TX1 已进入引导加载程序模式"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:52
#: d73ff67e478c43958873574cddb44c14
msgid "Next install JetPack and flash the OS"
msgstr "接下来安装 JetPack 并烧录操作系统"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:54
#: 4aa625ee27b64a1c9bfee3bb9ac16128
msgid ""
"connect an Ubuntu 16.04 machine to the internet and download `JetPack-3.1 "
"<https://developer.nvidia.com/embedded/dlc/jetpack-l4t-3_1>`__ (nvidia login"
" required)"
msgstr ""
"将 Ubuntu 16.04 机器连接到互联网并下载 `JetPack-3.1 "
"<https://developer.nvidia.com/embedded/dlc/jetpack-l4t-3_1>`__（需要 nvidia "
"账号登录）"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:55
#: a32267af83be4703934473631d206bbe
msgid ""
"move the downloaded file to the directory you want JetPack installed into "
"(i.e. \"~/Desktop/JetPack-3.1\")"
msgstr "将下载的文件移动到您希望安装 JetPack 的目录（如「~/Desktop/JetPack-3.1」）"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:56
#: e7d963350ec94e81ac1c2763f02c779b
msgid ""
"make sure the file is executable by typing, \"chmod a+x "
"JetPack-L4T-3.1-linux-x64.run\""
msgstr "输入「chmod a+x JetPack-L4T-3.1-linux-x64.run」确保文件可执行"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:57
#: 54aa40c7f7694966a6a0c5667d987a9b
msgid ""
"start the installation by running the downloaded file, "
"\"./JetPack-L4T-3.1-linux-x64.run\""
msgstr "运行下载的文件「./JetPack-L4T-3.1-linux-x64.run」开始安装"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:58
#: 943c0000de8d4ec1ade5d367c7bbf567
msgid "a \"JetPack L4T 3.1 Installer\" window should appear, press \"Next\""
msgstr "应出现「JetPack L4T 3.1 Installer」窗口，点击「Next」"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:59
#: 6e6d4ac79d874b6cad830039f4f26561
msgid ""
"a \"Installation Configuration\" page should appear confirming where JetPack"
" will be installed, press \"Next\""
msgstr "应出现「Installation Configuration」页面，确认 JetPack 的安装位置，点击「Next」"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:60
#: 9ca91351a899434d8fb4a3127659b3ca
msgid ""
"a \"Select Development Environment\" page should appear allowing you to "
"select the board type, select \"Jetson TX1\""
msgstr "应出现「Select Development Environment」页面，选择板卡类型，选择「Jetson TX1」"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:64
#: 0540ac38000641b1a2258095bfe6aa39
msgid ""
"an \"Installing\" page will appear asking for your password in order to "
"begin the local installation"
msgstr "将出现「Installing」页面，要求输入密码以开始本地安装"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:65
#: b2e68a97b54f4f289a1ed5ad88467007
msgid "a \"JetPack L4T Component Manager\" screen should appear"
msgstr "应出现「JetPack L4T Component Manager」界面"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:67
#: e94f70e7066643438a3cb6c4015bfbf0
msgid ""
"from the top left, select \"JetPack L4T 3.0\" (this may need to be selected "
"twice to work)"
msgstr "从左上角选择「JetPack L4T 3.0」（可能需要选择两次才能生效）"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:68
#: 30873127e6744004a796df63d8fee73e
msgid ""
"for \"Host - Ubuntu\" set the \"Action\" column to \"no action\" for "
"everything (select \"Keep & Apply\" if a question pops up)"
msgstr ""
"对于「Host - Ubuntu」，将所有项目的「Action」列设为「no action」（若弹出询问，选择「Keep & Apply」）"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:69
#: 5d66bb5f7f304908823d9b5c873fe79b
msgid "Target - Jetson TX1: mixed"
msgstr "Target - Jetson TX1：mixed"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:70
#: 9636ffe090b447cd9182b36e5d8bdf52
msgid "Linux for Tegra Host Side Image Setup: install"
msgstr "Linux for Tegra Host Side Image Setup：install"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:71
#: bf515e7d7c2841248f3c0e9082bff432
msgid "Flash OS Image to Target: install 24.2.1"
msgstr "Flash OS Image to Target：install 24.2.1"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:72
#: aa73b127852e415a8a2f387e16a3c8af
msgid "Install on Target: mixed"
msgstr "Install on Target：mixed"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:73
#: 973f3949c83a40f69bea602763e7ad57
msgid "CUDA Toolkit: install"
msgstr "CUDA Toolkit：install"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:74
#: 44c9960e1c34412ebf8afd414b499935
msgid "Compile CUDA Samples: no action"
msgstr "Compile CUDA Samples：no action"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:75
#: 16b7e6d0be5846bfb2becc134eed7bd0
msgid "PerfKit: install"
msgstr "PerfKit：install"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:76
#: 4911cc3afba84eb29d4e91d8c25f79ad
msgid "TensorRT: install"
msgstr "TensorRT：install"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:77
#: 16cbdb1125dc4dfa817387b5a28d9367
msgid "Multimedia API package: no action"
msgstr "Multimedia API package：no action"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:78
#: f814dfce1ffc46c88106557783ba0edf
msgid "cuDNN Package: install"
msgstr "cuDNN Package：install"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:79
#: 0705a2cea3b34e688079f169002ee9cb
msgid "OpenCV for Tegra: install"
msgstr "OpenCV for Tegra：install"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:80
#: 5dd9b8498e584df1bd98ad392ffd4106
msgid "VisionWorks on TX1 Target: no action"
msgstr "VisionWorks on TX1 Target：no action"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:84
#: 1fe22c5edfc542feb27321b97c08feee
msgid ""
"an \"Terms & Conditions\" window may appear, select \"Accept All\" and push "
"the \"Accept\" button"
msgstr "可能出现「Terms & Conditions」窗口，选择「Accept All」并点击「Accept」按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:85
#: d3dd026d95ef4e87968fe68601d3bd98
msgid "a \"Host installation is complete\" window should appear, press \"Next\""
msgstr "应出现「Host installation is complete」窗口，点击「Next」"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:86
#: 1d06e9cd00a84a41a21d5deec1efbed1
msgid ""
"a \"Network Layout - Jetson TX1\" window should appear, select \"Device "
"accesses Internet via router/switch\" after first ensuring the TX1 and "
"Ubuntu machine are connected to the internet with an ethernet cable"
msgstr ""
"应出现「Network Layout - Jetson TX1」窗口，首先确保 TX1 和 Ubuntu "
"机器已通过以太网线连接到互联网，然后选择「Device accesses Internet via router/switch」"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:87
#: 632cac85db9c44489759f1ff60ab074c
msgid ""
"if a \"Network Interface Selection\" window pops up, select the Ubuntu "
"machine's network connection that corresponds to the ethernet cable"
msgstr "若弹出「Network Interface Selection」窗口，选择 Ubuntu 机器上对应以太网线的网络连接"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:91
#: a3b3d06214c64f3f9792be54a6a7e2cf
msgid "a \"Post Installation Jetson TX1\" window may appear, press \"Next\""
msgstr "可能出现「Post Installation Jetson TX1」窗口，点击「Next」"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:92
#: 3d5cb516665341f9bc7ba66314fdc949
msgid ""
"a black console window titled, \"Post Installation\" should appear asking "
"that the TX1 be put in bootloader mode (this should already have been done),"
" Press \"Enter\""
msgstr ""
"应出现标题为「Post Installation」的黑色控制台窗口，要求将 TX1 置于引导加载程序模式（应已完成此操作），按「Enter」"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:93
#: 1c9b215363384fff81250225fcc7c061
msgid ""
"installation should continue for about 15min and finally a message should "
"appear asking you to close the black console window."
msgstr "安装将继续约 15 分钟，最终出现提示要求关闭黑色控制台窗口的消息。"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:94
#: aeb617ad52294ebaa25b8291300396f8
msgid ""
"an \"Installation Complete\" window should appear, leave \"Remove downloaded"
" files\" unchecked and press \"Finish\""
msgstr "应出现「Installation Complete」窗口，不勾选「Remove downloaded files」并点击「Finish」"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:96
#: 8a946f5326ee440ebd92097e9e84a02d
msgid ""
"These instructions can also be found in `\"Step1 : install NVidia image onto"
" the TX1\" from here "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/companion/blob/master/Nvidia_JTX1/Ubuntu/1_create_base_image.txt>`__."
msgstr ""
"这些说明也可在 `「Step1：将 NVidia 镜像安装到 "
"TX1」<https://github.com/ArduPilot/companion/blob/master/Nvidia_JTX1/Ubuntu/1_create_base_image.txt>`__"
" 中找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:99
#: 8efe8b53c8464ec8b7cfb0d0538261f1
msgid "Flashing the APSync image to the TX1"
msgstr "将 APSync 镜像烧录到 TX1"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:101
#: 85e3ed3c116f4653867e491eb30b203c
msgid ""
"connect a USB cable from the Ubuntu 16 machine to the TX1 development board,"
" power on the TX1 and put the TX1 into bootloader mode (see instructions "
"above)"
msgstr "将 USB 线从 Ubuntu 16 机器连接到 TX1 开发板，给 TX1 上电并将其置于引导加载程序模式（参见上述说明）"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:102
#: 4efd950d578e4c10bd384ac794cf20b4
msgid ""
"On the Ubuntu 16 machine, download the latest `APSync image for the tx1 "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Companion/apsync/apsync-tx1-latest-"
"img.xz>`__ from `firmware.ardupilot.org "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Companion/apsync/>`__ (look for images "
"starting with \"tx1\")."
msgstr ""
"在 Ubuntu 16 机器上，从 `firmware.ardupilot.org "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Companion/apsync/>`__ 下载最新的 `适用于 TX1 的 "
"APSync 镜像 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Companion/apsync/apsync-"
"tx1-latest-img.xz>`__（查找以「tx1」开头的镜像）。"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:103
#: cd7c169353e149caabf523846b6c5c6a
msgid ""
"uncompress the downloaded image (i.e. open a file explorer, right-mouse-"
"button click on the file and select \"Extract Here\")"
msgstr "解压下载的镜像（即打开文件管理器，右键单击文件并选择「在此处解压」）"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:104
#: 4924f5f89bae48cb8409c8091bbd58cc
msgid ""
"on the Ubuntu machine, from the directory where you installed JetPack (i.e. "
"~/Desktop/JetPack-3.1)"
msgstr "在 Ubuntu 机器上，切换到您安装 JetPack 的目录（如 ~/Desktop/JetPack-3.1）"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:105
#: 1adb1a8ebf8f415faa0bd21080769ae4
msgid "cd 64_TX1/Linux_for_Tegra_64_tx1/bootloader"
msgstr "cd 64_TX1/Linux_for_Tegra_64_tx1/bootloader"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:106
#: 7a707b10a80b402ea37a22e58e4c74fb
msgid ""
"run this command but replace IMAGE.img with the name of the image "
"downloaded, sudo ./tegraflash.py --bl cboot.bin --applet "
"nvtboot_recovery.bin --chip 0x21 --cmd \"write APP IMAGE.img\""
msgstr ""
"运行以下命令，将 IMAGE.img 替换为下载的镜像文件名：sudo ./tegraflash.py --bl cboot.bin --applet "
"nvtboot_recovery.bin --chip 0x21 --cmd 「write APP IMAGE.img」"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:110
#: 06fae8da4748434db333c78d2183cc2a
msgid ""
"Official instructions from NVidia on flashing images can be found `here "
"<https://devtalk.nvidia.com/default/topic/898999/jetson-tx1/tx1-r23-1-new-"
"flash-structure-how-to-clone-/post/4784149/#4784149>`__."
msgstr ""
"NVidia 的官方烧录镜像说明可在 `此处 "
"<https://devtalk.nvidia.com/default/topic/898999/jetson-tx1/tx1-r23-1-new-"
"flash-structure-how-to-clone-/post/4784149/#4784149>`__ 找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:113
#: d4935187ac1544b09b42338df04b9143
msgid "Notes if using ZED camera"
msgstr "使用 ZED 摄像头的注意事项"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:115
#: 0b8dbe7f15224bc0879b396108f3b60f
msgid ""
"If you are using the `StereoLabs <https://www.stereolabs.com/>`__ :ref:`ZED "
"camera <copter:common-zed>` then the TX1 will need to be powered up once "
"with the ethernet cable plugged in so that it has access to the internet in "
"order to download the camera's factory calibration."
msgstr ""
"如果使用 `StereoLabs <https://www.stereolabs.com/>`__ :ref:`ZED 摄像头 "
"<copter:common-zed>`，TX1 需要在插入以太网线的情况下启动一次，以便访问互联网下载摄像头的出厂标定数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx1.rst:117
